{"title":"Rc sellner","slug":"Rc_sellner~4239","hero":{"file":"RCSellner.webp","width":400,"height":223},"pageid":4239,"revid":19469,"timestamp":"2025-09-03T20:01:23Z","lastEditor":"ArsyGame","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Santa’s Workshop"},{"label":"Price","value":"700 snowflakes"},{"label":"Function","value":"Small RC truck"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.71"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01.12.2024"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: (from left to right) normal or common colors, rare colors, neon\">(from left to right) normal or common colors, rare colors, neon</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/6_RARES_LEFT!!!.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>(from left to right) normal or common colors, rare colors, neon. </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>RC Sellner (RC Sellner Explorer) is a small vehicle. As the name suggests, it is a small <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sellner_Explorer/\">Sellner Explorer</a>. The player can drive it remotely and it can hold some cargo (e.g. 1 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pear/\">pear</a>) with some glitches, so drive slowly. It doesn’t have wall at the back side (like the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Basic_Trailer/\">Basic Trailer</a>), so the cargo can fall off on slopes. However, its maximum speed is 34 studs/s. It can be moved by <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Straight_Conveyor/\">conveyors</a> or other objects (as it’s an item) and this can be used to create obstacle courses. Like other items in Oaklands, when bought it will change color. It can change into all the colors that normal vehicles can, including rare and neon.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: all rare rc sellners\">all rare rc sellners</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/All_rc_sellners_rare.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>all rare rc sellners</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Unfortunately, trailers can not be hitched onto the <b>RC Sellner</b>.</li></ul>","alias":{"of":"RC Sellner","slug":"RC_Sellner"}}
